---
interface Props {
  lang: 'en' | 'zh';
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';
---
<figure class="dino-demo lab-widget" data-dino-demo data-locale={lang}>
  <div class="dino-stage">
    <p class="dino-fallback">
      {
        zh
          ? '需要 JavaScript 才能试玩。你仍可读速度规则，并打开下方源码与许可说明。'
          : 'Enable JavaScript to play. You can still read the rule and open the source and license notes below.'
      }
    </p>
    <canvas
      width="600"
      height="180"
      tabindex="0"
      hidden
      role="img"
      aria-label={
        zh
          ? '小型恐龙跑向仙人掌。还原速度：从 6 起步，低于 13 时每次更新加 0.001。'
          : 'A small dinosaur running toward a cactus. Recovered speed: starts at 6, increases by 0.001 per update while below 13.'
      }
    ></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="dino-controls" hidden>
    <div class="dino-buttons">
      <button class="dino-btn-primary" type="button" data-dino-start>
        {zh ? '开始' : 'Play'}
      </button>
      <button type="button" data-dino-jump>{zh ? '跳跃 ↑' : 'Jump ↑'}</button>
      <button type="button" data-dino-reset>{zh ? '重开' : 'Restart'}</button>
    </div>
    <label class="dino-speed-label">
      <span>{zh ? '速度' : 'Speed'} <output data-dino-speed>6.0</output></span>
      <input
        type="range"
        min="2"
        max="18"
        step="0.1"
        value="6"
        data-dino-slider
        aria-valuemin="2"
        aria-valuemax="18"
        aria-valuenow="6"
      />
    </label>
    <label class="dino-auto-label">
      <input type="checkbox" data-dino-auto checked />
      {zh ? '使用还原的加速规则' : 'Use the recovered acceleration rule'}
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="dino-status" data-dino-status role="status">
    {
      zh
        ? '原规则：从 6 起步，向 13 爬升。'
        : 'Original rule: start at 6, then increase toward 13.'
    }
  </p>
  <figcaption>
    {
      zh
        ? '教学小游戏：只还原加速规则；绘制、跳跃与碰撞为新写。拖动滑块可固定速度。空格或「跳跃」越过仙人掌。'
        : 'Teaching mini-game: only the acceleration rule is reconstructed; drawing, jump, and collision are new. Drag the slider for a fixed speed. Space or Jump clears a cactus.'
    }
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<script is:inline type="module" src="/scripts/showcase/dino-demo.js"></script>
